    "embarkation": "Embarked Melbourne 11.5.17 on ship A9 HMAT Shropshire. Rate of pay per diem before and after embarkation: Five Shillings. Australian War Memorial Embarkation Roll Number: 13/128/1. Later in this publication are more details about the ships that took individuals overseas.",
    "fate": "15.1.19 returned to Australia on board the ship HT City of Exeter. 2.3.19 discharged from 3rd Military District. Died 9.1.61 Bundoora. Age at death, 66 years. Death Registration 1961/444. Place of burial: Springvale Botanical Cemetery on 10.1.1961.",
