    "fate": "26.8.16 Killed in Action while serving with the 21st Infantry Battalion in France. Age at death according to cemetery records 18 years. Place of burial: Villers-Bretonneux Military Cemetery, (Plot IIIA, Row D, Grave No. 13), Fouilloy, France.",
