    "location": "Newlyn",
    "service": "Joined 5.4.16 Horsham. Service number: 2034. Rank: Private. Roll title: 38th Infantry Battalion, 1st to 6th Reinforcements, (June to December 1916). Age on enlistment: 35 years 8 months. Occupation: Skilled Labourer (Horsham). Marital status: Married. Religion: Church of Christ. Next of kin and address: wife, Mrs. Cecilia Atkins, Darlot Street Horsham. Embarked Melbourne 25.9.16 on ship A9 HMAT Shropshire. Rate of pay per diem before and after embarkation: Five Shillings. Original unit: 38th Battalion, 3rd Reinforcement. Australian War Memorial Embarkation Roll Number: 23/55/2. Later in this publication are more details about the ships that took individuals overseas.",
    "family": "Born Newlyn 1880. Birth Registration 1880/10491. Father: William Henry Atkins. Mother: Elizabeth May Johnson. Married Cecilia Victoria Abbott. Marriage Registration 1902/7002. Second Marriage to Eileen Elizabeth Alice Jackson 1940. Marriage Registration 1940/16689.",
    "enlistment": "Joined 5.4.16 Horsham. Service number: 2034. Rank: Private. Roll title: 38th Infantry Battalion, 1st to 6th Reinforcements, (June to December 1916). Age on enlistment: 35 years 8 months. Occupation: Skilled Labourer (Horsham). Marital status: Married. Religion: Church of Christ. Next of kin and address: wife, Mrs. Cecilia Atkins, Darlot Street Horsham.",
    "embarkation": "Embarked Melbourne 25.9.16 on ship A9 HMAT Shropshire. Rate of pay per diem before and after embarkation: Five Shillings. Original unit: 38th Battalion, 3rd Reinforcement. Australian War Memorial Embarkation Roll Number: 23/55/2. Later in this publication are more details about the ships that took individuals overseas.",
    "fate": "12.5.19 returned to Australia on board the ship Soudan. 6.8.19 discharged 3rd Military District as medically unfit. Died 1968 Horsham. Age at death, 87 years. Death Registration 1968/6609. Place of burial: Horsham Cemetery.",
    "recognition": "British War. Victory Medal. RSL Virtual War Memorial. Avenue of Honour Tree E122",
