    "fate": "Returned to Australia 2.3.1919 on board the ship Derbyshire. 14.6.19 discharged 3rd Military District. Died 26.12.57 Albury. Age at death, 60 years. Place of burial: Albury Old Cemetery on 27.12.57, Plan 11, Section PRES, Row F, Lot 52.",
