    "embarkation": "Embarked Adelaide 11.10.15 on ship A71 HMAT Nestor. Rate of pay per diem before and after embarkation: Five Shillings. Original unit: 8th Battalion, 11th Reinforcement. Australian War Memorial Embarkation Roll Number: 23/25/4. Later in this publication are more details about the ships that took individuals overseas.",
    "fate": "22.2.17 returned to Australia on board the ship Karoola. 30.5.17 discharged 3rd Military District as medically unfit with trench feet. Died 9.4.59 Heidelberg. Age at death, 69 years. Death Registration 1959/4512. Place of burial: Fawkner Memorial Park 11.4.1959.",
