    "embarkation": "Embarked Melbourne 29.12.15 on ship A64 HMAT Demosthenes. Rate of pay per diem before and after embarkation: Five Shillings. Original unit: 21st Battalion, 8th Reinforcement. Australian War Memorial Embarkation Roll Number: 23/38/2. Later in this publication are more details about the ships that took individuals overseas.",
