    "fate": "29.11.18 returned to Australia on ship Riverina. 13.12.18 discharged 2nd Military District. Died 18.8.1977 Melbourne. Age at death, 77 years. Death Registration 1977/20547. Place of burial: Springvale Botanical Cemetery on 19.8.1977.",
