    "enlistment": "Joined 6.12.15 Ballarat. Service number: 4753. Rank: Private. Roll title: 14th Infantry Battalion, 13th to 23rd Reinforcements (December 1915 to November 1916). Age on enlistment: 22 years 8 months. Occupation: Farm Labourer. Marital status: Single. Religion: Methodist. Next of kin and address: father, Nicholas Bullen, c/o Newlyn Post Office.",
