    "fate": "15.1.19 returned to Australia on board the ship City of Exeter. 16.4.19 discharged 3rd Military District. Died 19.12.1981 Ballarat. Age at death, 88 years. Death Registration 1981/28850. Place of burial: Ballarat General (New) Cemetery 22.12.1981.",
