    "embarkation": "Embarked Sydney 3.9.17 on the ship A55 HMAT Kyarra. Rate of pay per diem before and after embarkation: Five Shillings. Original unit: Special Draft reinforcements, Signal Service (Egypt). Later in this publication are more details about the ships that took individuals overseas.",
    "fate": "15.6.19 returned to Australia on board the ship HT Essex from Suez. 24.8.19 discharged 3rd Military District. Died 1959 McKinnon. Age at death, 60 years. Death Registration 1959/3246. Cremated at Springvale Botanical Cemetery 3.3.1959 and ashes taken.",
