    "enlistment": "Joined 1.8.17 Ballarat. Service number: 6770. Rank: Private. Roll title: 21st Infantry Battalion, 19th and 20th Reinforcements, (May to November 1917). Age on enlistment: 19 years 11 months. Occupation: Bank Clerk (Ballarat). Marital status: Single. Religion: Church of England. Next of kin and address: father, Robert Edward Chapman, Bank of New South Wales, Ballarat.",
