    "notes": "Prior experience: 4 years in Senior Cadets and 2 years with 71st Infantry Battalion. 15.12.17 disembarked HMAT Nestor at Suez. 22.1.18 till mid-May, made a number of trips to hospital in Cherbourg France for treatment of an undisclosed illness. Remained in isolation while rest of unit proceeded to Western Front. 18.4.18 changed address for father as next of kin from Bank of New South Wales Ballarat to “Nyora,” Cooper Street Strathfield NSW. 4.10.18 proceeded overseas to France from Fovant as part of the reinforcements for 2nd Battalion. 22.10.18 at Le Havre, transferred to 21st Battalion in the field. 24.2.19 admitted to 6th Field Ambulance and then evacuated to Bulford Military Hospital England for treatment of disease.",
