    "notes": "Private from 27.1.16; Gunner from 12.2.16. 14.9.16 disembarked Plymouth. 10.10.16 admitted to Bulford Military Hospital for treatment of disease. 31.12.16 taken on strength with 10th Field Artillery Brigade at Etaples, France. 28.7.17 treated at 15th Casualty Clearing Station, France, injury unclear. Returned to duty 12.8.17. 22.4.18 Wounded in Action at Rouen, France. (Gunshot wound to neck.) Treated by 20th Casualty Clearing Station. Then treated by 6th Auxiliary Field Ambulance Rouen. Rejoined unit from Hospital 18.5.18. 26.5.18 Wounded in Action. (Gassed.) Treated by 9th Australian Field Ambulance for conjunctivitis as a result of gassing to eyes. 14.7.17 discharged back to unit. 1.11.18 admitted to Shorncliffe Military Hospital for treatment of disease while on leave in England. Transferred to Bulford Military Hospital. Discharged 12.1.19.",
