    "embarkation": "Embarked Melbourne 2.2.15 on ship A51 HMAT Chilka. Rate of pay per diem before and after embarkation: Six Shillings. Original unit: 3rd Light Horse Field Ambulance, Egypt. Australian War Memorial Embarkation Roll Number: 26/41/1.",
