    "fate": "10.6 .19 returned to Australia aboard ship HT Runic. 2.8.19 discharged 3rd Military District. Died 2.6.1975 Heidelberg. Age at death, 80 years. Death Registration 1975/12719. Place of burial: Springvale Botanical Cemetery on 4.6.1975.",
