    "service": "Joined 24.7.15 Ballarat. Service number: 3743 (and 3774). Rank: Private. Roll title: 14th Infantry Battalion, 5th to 12th Reinforcements, (April to November 1915). Age on enlistment: 21 years. Marital status: Single. Religion: Roman Catholic. Occupation: Labourer. Next of kin and address: father, Duff Green, Springmount, via Creswick. Embarked Melbourne 23.11.15 on ship A40 HMAT Ceramic. Rate of pay per diem before and after embarkation: Five Shillings. Original unit: 14th Battalion, 12th Reinforcement. Australian War Memorial Embarkation Roll Number: 23/31/3. Later in this publication are more details about the ships that took individuals overseas.",
    "family": "Born Kingston 10.4.1893. Birth Registration 1893/8954. Father: Duff Green. Mother: Margaret McManus. Married Iris Evelyn Potter 1921. Marriage registration 1921/7254.",
    "enlistment": "Joined 24.7.15 Ballarat. Service number: 3743 (and 3774). Rank: Private. Roll title: 14th Infantry Battalion, 5th to 12th Reinforcements, (April to November 1915). Age on enlistment: 21 years. Marital status: Single. Religion: Roman Catholic. Occupation: Labourer. Next of kin and address: father, Duff Green, Springmount, via Creswick.",
    "embarkation": "Embarked Melbourne 23.11.15 on ship A40 HMAT Ceramic. Rate of pay per diem before and after embarkation: Five Shillings. Original unit: 14th Battalion, 12th Reinforcement. Australian War Memorial Embarkation Roll Number: 23/31/3. Later in this publication are more details about the ships that took individuals overseas.",
    "fate": "16.3.19 returned to Australia aboard ship HT Dunluce Castle. Transshipped by Czaritza to Dunluce Castle from Weymouth. 24.4.21 discharged 3rd Military District as medically unfit. Died 8.4.1973, Ballarat. Age at death, 79 years. Death Registration 1973/9242. Place of burial: Ballarat (New) Cemetery on 10.4.1974.",
    "recognition": "Military Medal. 1914–15 Star. British War Medal. Victory Medal. Springmount State School Honour Board. RSL Virtual War Memorial. Avenue of Honour Tree E80",
