    "fate": "4.10.17 Killed in Action while serving with the 22nd Infantry Battalion in Belgium. Age at death, 18 years. Place of burial: La Laiterie Military Cemetery (Plot I, Row D, Grave Number II), Kemmel, Belgium.",
