    "fate": "22.2.17 returned to Australia aboard hospital ship HT Karoola from Avonmouth England. 3.6.17 discharged 3rd Military District on medical grounds. 23 October 1919 Creswick. Death Registration 1919/16878. Age at death, 30 years. Place of burial: Creswick Cemetery on 27.10.1919",
