    "fate": "22.1.20 returned to Australia on board the ship HT Friedrichsruh. 9.3.20 discharged 3rd military district on medical grounds. 15.2.64 died Geelong. Age at death, 67 years. Death Registration 1964/3096. Place of burial: Geelong Western Public Cemetery on 17.2.64.",
