    "fate": "21.4.18 return to Australia on board the Suevic from Weymouth. 25.76.18 discharged from 3rd Military District as medically unfit with pes cavus. Died 1972 at Castlemaine. Age at death, 95 years. Death Registration 1972/26498.",
