    "enlistment": "Joined 28.9.15 Melbourne. Service number: 4344. Rank: Private. Roll title: 14th Infantry Battalion, 13th to 23rd Reinforcements, (December 1915 to November 1916). Age on enlistment: 21 years. Occupation: Labourer. Marital status: single. Religion: Methodist. Address at date of enlistment: 2 Waltham Road, Newport. Next of kin and address: father, John Heron, 2 Waltham Road, Newport.",
