    "notes": "6.3.16 at Heilopolis, taken on strength of 3rd Reserve Regiment. 1.4.16 transferred to 4th Division Artillery at Serapeum, Egypt. 7.4.16 taken on strength as Mustered Gunner at Serapeum. 1.7.16 forfeited one day’s pay for removing blankets used for covering rifles. 3.7.16 mustered as Driver in Marseilles. 28.11.17 admitted to 10th Field Ambulance with undisclosed illness. 7.12.17 discharged back to unit in the field. 28.11.17 in the field with 4th Divisional Ammunition Column. 11.8.18 Wounded in Action with 10th Field Artillery Brigade. (Gunshot flesh wound to lower back.) Initially treated by 13th Field Ambulance. Then to 56th Casualty Clearing Station. Admitted to 5th General Hospital, Rouen, France. Embarked France for England and admitted to Northampton War Hospital Duston England. Returned to unit 25.1.19.",
