    "notes": "Prior experience: 18 months with Citizen Forces and two years with Senior Cadets. 2.10.17 joined Army Veterinary Corps in Maribyrnong. 25.4.18 joined ANZAC Mounted Division. 27.4.18 caught train from Melbourne to Sydney to embark on SS Port Darwin. 7.6.18 disembarked Suez. 19.7.18 taken on strength with BEF [British Expeditionary Force] Moascar, Egypt. 11.10.18 Driver. 18.10.18 admitted to hospital with undisclosed illness. 29.10.18 at 31st General Hospital Abbassia, Egypt where he was diagnosed with malaria. 3.12.18 Creswick Advertiser reported that Private Jeffrey from Smeaton had been a District Volunteer. At the time of his death, he was recorded as being a resident of North Brighton and occupation clothing manufacturer.",
