    "enlistment": "Joined 13.7.15 Melbourne. Service number: 4807. Original Rank: Private. Roll title: 8th Infantry Battalion, 13th to 23rd Reinforcements, (December 1915 to November 1916). Age on enlistment: 25 years 10 months. Occupation: Railway Clerk. Marital status: Single. Religion: Church of England. Next of kin and address: father, Mr. Jack Johannsen, Allendale.",
