    "embarkation": "Embarked Melbourne 23.11.16 on ship A20 HMAT Hororata. Rate of pay per diem before and after embarkation: Five Shillings. Original unit: 24th Battalion, 18th Reinforcement. Australian War Memorial Embarkation Roll Number: 23/41/4. Later in this publication are more details about the ships that took individuals overseas.",
