    "fate": "21.10.19 left Great Britain for Australia in a Sopwith Wallaby aircraft, designed for long flights. Despite several mishaps they flew as far as Bali, but crash landed. 10.6.20 arrived in Australia aboard the Roggeveen. 16.8.20 discharged 3rd Military District. Died 19.5.1963 Queensland.",
