    "fate": "24.1.19 returned to Australia on board the ship Delta. 24.4.19 discharged 3rd Military District as medically unfit. Died 7.4.1961 Newcombe. Age at death, 71 years. Death Registration 1961/5773. Cremated at Altona Memorial Park where cremated remains were interred.",
