    "service": "Joined 1.2.15 Horsham. Service number: 188. Rank: Private. Roll title: 22nd Infantry Battalion (May 1915). Age on enlistment: 23 years 9 months. Marital status: Single. Religion: Roman Catholic. Occupation: Grocer. Next of kin and address: mother, Mary Lever, Allendale. Embarked Melbourne 10.5.15 on ship A38 HMAT Ulysses. Rate of pay per diem before and after embarkation: Five Shillings. Original unit: 22nd Battalion, A Company. Australian War Memorial Embarkation Roll Number: 23/39/1. Later in this publication are more details about the ships that took individuals overseas.",
