    "notes": "30.12.15 admitted to 3rd Canadian Staff Hospital, Mudros with jaundice. 16.1.16 treated for jaundice at 1st Auxiliary General Hospital, Cairo, Egypt. 10.3.16 joined 4th Australian Field Butchery Unit, Tel El Kebir, Egypt. 18.3.16 temporary promotion to Quartermaster Sergeant. 26.5.16 promoted to Quartermaster Sergeant 27.5.16 temporary promotion to Warrant Officer Class 1 Serapeum, Egypt. 26.11.16 admitted to 1st Australian General Hospital Rouen for influenza. 6.1.16 evacuated from Le Havre, France to England for further treatment. 28.9.18 returned to England in preparation to be repatriated back to Australia. 15.10.18 admitted to Queen Alexandra Military Hospital, Millbank, London, suffering pneumonia and cardiac failure. 31.12.18 Creswick Advertiser published a list of all from the Borough and Shire who had Died of Sickness while on active duty and this included Warrant Officer McAndrew.",
