    "notes": "26.9.15 admitted to hospital in Mustapha Camp, Alexandria, Egypt for treatment of disease. Transferred to Malta. 25.10.15 returned to duty at Gallipoli. 22.1.16 departed Malta for Egypt on HT Euripides with 8th Light Horse Regiment having been assessed as being fit for active service. 27.10.16 admitted to 31st General Hospital with debility. 15.11.16 discharged to unit at Moascar, Egypt. 26.4.17 Ishmailia Egypt, admonished for (1) disobeying an order in that he was unshaven on parade and (2) neglect of duty in that he did not report the non-issue of salt with camel feeds. 11.5.18 admitted to 14th General Hospital Port Said, Egypt with malaria. 3.12.18 Creswick Advertiser reported that Lance Corporal McHutchison from Broomfield had been a District Volunteer.",
