    "recognition": "British War Medal. Victory Medal. Kingston State School Honour Board. RSL Virtual War Memorial. Avenue of Honour Tree W42 Family Military Connections Brother, Private Andrew Charles McKinnon, [No. 323], 8th Infantry Battalion, Killed in Action 19.7.1916. Brother, Private Norman McKinnon, [No. 7553], 8th Infantry Battalion, returned to Australia 13.7.19. Sister, Staff Nurse Ruby McKinnon. [Served in Australia] Cousin, Private James Lindsay Archibald, [No. 677], 14th Infantry Battalion, Killed in Action France, 13.8.16.",
