    "service": "Joined 13.6.17 Melbourne. Rank: Staff Nurse. Unit: Australian Army Nursing Service, No. 5 Australian General Hospital. Age on enlistment: 28 years. Occupation: Trained Nurse. Marital status: Single. Religion: Presbyterian. Next of kin and address: father, Mr. A. McKinnon, Kingston Post Office. Although she enlisted for active service, she was not sent abroad as there were several applicants in front of her and the war ceased.",
