    "embarkation": "Embarked Melbourne 29.12.15 on ship A64 HMAT Demosthernes. Original unit: 14th Infantry Battalion. Australian War Memorial Embarkation Roll Number: 23/31/4. Later in this publication are more details about the ships that took individuals overseas.",
    "fate": "11.4.17 Killed in Action while serving with the 46th Battalion at Bullecourt. No Known Grave.",
    "recognition": "British War Medal. Victory Medal. Memorial Plaque. Memorial Scroll. Allendale State School Honour Board. RSL Virtual War Memorial. Avenue of Honour Tree E38",
