    "fate": "22.7.17 returned to Australia on board ship HS Nestor. 5.11.17 discharged 3rd Military District. Died 1.6.50 Ballarat. Age at death, 59 years. Death Registration 1950/17978. Place of burial: Ballarat (New) Cemetery on 2.6.1950.",
