    "notes": "Prior experience: 11 months with Citizen Forces, 45th Infantry. 23.2.16 joined 58th Battalion at Zeitoun, Egypt. 15.3.16 transferred to 59th Battalion at Tel-el-Kebir, Egypt. 28.7.16 reported as Missing in Action. 4.8.17 Court of Inquiry determined that he had been Killed in Action at Fromelles, France on 19.7.16 while part of the 60th Infantry Battalion AIF. 19.1.17 Creswick Advertiser reported that Private Martin was Missing in Action. 3.12.18 Creswick Advertiser reported that Private Martin from Wonthaggi had been a District Volunteer. 31.12.18 Creswick Advertiser published a list of all from the Borough and Shire who had been Killed in Action including Private Martin. Enlisted with written consent of both parents. Red Cross File No. 1720509.",
