    "fate": "21.9.17 Died of Wounds while serving with 8th Infantry Battalion at Polygon Wood, Ypres, Belgium. Age at death, 23 years but cemetery records show 24. Place of burial: Lijssenthoek Military Cemetery, (Plot XXIX, Row H, Grave Number 19), Belgium.",
