    "service": "Joined 14.9.14 Stratford. Service number: 604. Rank: Private. Roll title: 9th Light Horse Regiment, 1st Reinforcement. Age on enlistment: 21 years. Occupation: Labourer. Marital status: Single. Religion: Church of England. Next of kin and address: W. E. Lestrange, Bushy Park Victoria. Embarked Melbourne 6.2.15 on ship A52 HMAT Surada. Original unit: 5th Field Artillery. Australian War Memorial Embarkation Roll Number: 10/14/2. Later in this publication are more details about the ships that took individuals overseas.",
    "family": "Born Newlyn 15.3.1895. Birth Registration 1895/14564. Father: Duncan May. Mother: Elizabeth Ann Russell. Married Ruby Linaker 1921. Marriage Registration 1921/8704.",
