    "embarkation": "Embarked Melbourne 6.2.15 on ship A52 HMAT Surada. Original unit: 5th Field Artillery. Australian War Memorial Embarkation Roll Number: 10/14/2. Later in this publication are more details about the ships that took individuals overseas.",
    "fate": "14.12.18 returned to Australia aboard the ship HT Burmah. 30.3.19 discharged 3rd Military District. Died 10.2.1971 Heidelberg. Age at death, 75 years. Buried 12.2.71 Springvale Cemetary. Death Registration 1971/3730.",
    "recognition": "1914–15 Star. British War Medal. Victory Medal. RSL Virtual War Memorial. Avenue of Honour Tree E23",
