    "notes": "Prior experience: 16 years\nwith 19th\nLight Horse.\nLieutenant upon joining;\nCaptain from 8.6.15;\nActing Major from 28.1.19.\nFinal Rank: Major.\nCaptain of 4th\nLight Horse,\npromotion date: 8th\nJune\n1915.\n8.10.15 admitted to General\nHospital, Gibraltar with\ndysentery and dilation of the\nheart.\n31.10.15 admitted to 3rd\nLondon General Hospital\nWandsworth with\nParatyphoid Fever A and B.\n23.3.16 Medical Board at AIF\nHeadquarters declared\nMajor Parkin was unfit for all\nduties for a period of two\nmonths owing to the\nlingering effects of\nparatyphoid A and B picked\nup on Gallipoli Peninsular.\n8.8.16 returned to Australia\nfor six months change.\n22.6.17 boarded the Port\nLincoln. 6.8.17 disembarked\nat Suez.\n11.8.17 taken on strength of\n4th\nLight Horse Training\nRegiment.\n20.10.17 to temporary\nCommand of C Squadron at\nTel-el-Fara.",
