    "recognition": "• Meritorious Service\nMedal.\n• Mentioned in Despatches.\n• 1914–15 Star.\n• British War Medal.\n• Victory Medal.\n• Newlyn State School\nHonour Board.\n• RSL Virtual War Memorial.\nAvenue of Honour Tree W55",
