    "enlistment": "Joined 16.8.16 Melbourne.\nService number: 425. Rank:\nPrivate. Roll title: 2nd\nMachine Gun Company, 2nd\nto 10th\nReinforcements (May\n1916 to January 1917). Age\non enlistment: 25 years 10\nmonths. Occupation:\nLabourer. Marital status:\nSingle. Religion: Catholic.\nNext of kin and address:\nfather, George B. Redford\nSpringmount via Creswick.",
