    "fate": "21.12.18 returned to\nAustralia on board the ship\nMamari.\n6.3.19 discharged 3rd\nMilitary\nDistrict.\nDied 24.10.1972 Ashwood.\nAge at death, 74 years. Death\nRegistration 1972/25287. Cremated\nat Springvale Botanical\nCemetery on 25.10.1972.",
    "recognition": "• British War Medal.\n• Victory Medal.\n• Allendale State School\nHonour Board.\n• Kooroocheang State\nSchool Honour Board.\n• RSL Virtual War\nMemorial.\nAvenue of Honour Tree W48",
