    "enlistment": "Joined 4.6.17. Rank: Staff\nNurse. Roll title: Nurses (July\n1915 to November 1918).\nAge on enlistment: 33 years.\nOccupation: Trained Nurse\n(Melbourne). Marital status:\nSingle. Religion: Methodist.\nNext of kin and address:\nfather, John White,\nAllendale.",
