    "additionalNotes": "",
    "notes": "Prior experience: three years\nat Colac District Hospital.\n19.7.17 arrived Suez, Egypt.\n25.7.17 embarked\nAlexandria for Salonika on\nboard the Chargis.\nFrom 30.7.17 to 14.2.19\nserved with 42nd\n, 52nd\n, 60th\n,\nand 66th\nGeneral Hospitals at\nSalonika.\n14.2.19 embarked for\nEngland on the Kursk.\n28.2.19 disembarked\nSouthampton with orders to\nreport to AIF Headquarters,\nLondon.\n22.3.19 attached for duty\nwith 3rd\nAustralian Army\nHospital.\nAfter returning to Australia,\nLaura continued nursing with\nthe Australian Army Nursing\nService until her discharge\nwith the rank of Sister.\nMentioned in Despatches,\nAwarded and promulgated\nLondon Gazette, second\nSupplement No. 30448,\ndated 28.12.1918.\nDeath registration\nincorrectly spells her\nsurname as Welch. Also,\nmother's first name was\nrecorded as Hannah.",
