    "family": "Born Powlett Hill (but\nregistered for Smeaton)\n1896. Birth Registration 1896/6767.\nFather: William Wood.\nMother, Gertrude Helen\nHargreaves. Married Daisy\nFrances Bail 1920. Marriage\nRegistration 1920/128.",
    "enlistment": "Joined 1.9.17 Mildura.\nService number: V69567.\nRank: Private. Roll title: 3rd\nPioneer Battalion, 2nd\nReinforcement. Age on\nenlistment: 21 years 8\nmonths. Occupation: Farmer.\nMarital status: Single.\nReligion: Church of England.\nNext of kin and address:\nmother, Mrs. G. Helen\nWood, Powlett Hill.",
